  "rules": [
    "Strong product positives in event_name/event_subtitle/tags/exhibited_products override broad equipment terms when product family is clear.",
    "Broad themes alone are insufficient for yes; require product tags or maybe.",
    "Negative infrastructure/service/conference terms override weak positives when no product evidence exists.",
    "Canceled/status is not a relevance signal; filter availability after relevance scoring.",
    "Generic terms like Аксессуары, Оборудование, Технологии, Материалы, Сырье require context.",
    "Apply beverage_exclusion before final yes: beverage-only/drinks-only/brewing/wine/beer/coffee/tea/cacao/beverage-equipment/beverage-ingredient events are no.",
    "Mixed beverage plus other packaged consumer goods should be maybe unless clear non-beverage product evidence independently justifies yes.",
    "Do not treat packaging/tara/ingredients as positive when they occur only inside a beverage production/sales context."
  ],
